The MIT licence above covers the code only.  It does not cover the CMS
tables this code reads, which are not redistributed here: the PTP and MUE
quarterly files carry CPT codes and descriptions that are American Medical
Association property, and CMS distributes them under its own terms.  Fetch
them yourself with data/fetch.py, which verifies each file's SHA-256 against
data/manifest.csv.
